#: includes/Admin/Dashboard/Pages/Extensions.php:80
msgid ""
"weLabs is a sister concern of weDevs, specializing in customizing Dokan-related integrations and development. From bespoke feature development to complex integration work, weLabs helps you extend Dokan exactly the way your business needs."
msgstr ""
"weLabs é uma divisão especializada da weDevs, focada em personalizações e desenvolvimentos relacionados ao Dokan. De desenvolvimentos de funcionalidades sob medida a integrações complexas, a weLabs ajuda você a estender o Dokan exatamente do jeito que o seu negócio precisa."

#: includes/Admin/Dashboard/Pages/Extensions.php:102
msgid "Dokan WPML"
msgstr "Dokan WPML"

#: includes/Admin/Dashboard/Pages/Extensions.php:103
msgid ""
"Expand globally with multilingual support - translate your marketplace into multiple languages and reach more customers and vendors without barriers."
msgstr ""
"Expanda globalmente com suporte multilíngue: traduza seu marketplace para vários idiomas e alcance mais clientes e vendedores, sem barreiras."

#: includes/Admin/Dashboard/Pages/Extensions.php:113
msgid "Dokan Booking Addon"
msgstr "Dokan Booking Addon"

#: includes/Admin/Dashboard/Pages/Extensions.php:114
msgid ""
"Turn products into bookable services - let vendors offer appointments, rentals, and schedules to unlock new revenue streams effortlessly."
msgstr ""
"Transforme produtos em serviços agendáveis — permita que vendedores ofereçam agendamentos, aluguéis e horários para desbloquear novos fluxos de receita sem esforço."

#: includes/Admin/Dashboard/Pages/Extensions.php:125
msgid "Dokan Auction Addon"
msgstr "Dokan Auction Addon"

#: includes/Admin/Dashboard/Pages/Extensions.php:126
msgid ""
"Create excitement with auctions - enable bidding on products to increase engagement, competition, and maximize your overall sales value."
msgstr ""
"Crie entusiasmo com leilões — ative lances em produtos para aumentar engajamento, competição e maximizar o valor geral de vendas."

#: includes/Admin/Dashboard/Pages/Extensions.php:137
msgid "Dokan PDF Invoice"
msgstr "Dokan PDF Invoice"

#: includes/Admin/Dashboard/Pages/Extensions.php:138
msgid ""
"Generate professional PDF invoices automatically - streamline order management and give your marketplace a more trusted, polished experience."
msgstr ""
"Gere faturas PDF profissionais automaticamente — simplifique o gerenciamento de pedidos e dê ao seu marketplace uma experiência mais confiável e polida."

#: includes/Admin/Dashboard/Pages/Extensions.php:148
#: includes/Admin/RecommendedPlugins.php:28
msgid "FlyCRM"
msgstr "FlyCRM"

#: includes/Admin/Dashboard/Pages/Extensions.php:149
msgid ""
"Keep customers and vendors organized - store contacts, track deals, and nurture every relationship to drive repeat marketplace revenue."
msgstr ""
"Mantenha clientes e vendedores organizados — armazene contatos, acompanhe negócios e cultive cada relacionamento para impulsionar receita recorrente do marketplace."

#: includes/Admin/Dashboard/Pages/Extensions.php:159
#: includes/Admin/RecommendedPlugins.php:37
msgid "wePos"
msgstr "wePos"

#: includes/Admin/Dashboard/Pages/Extensions.php:160
msgid ""
"Run your physical store smarter - manage sales, inventory, and customers in real time with a powerful POS built for WooCommerce."
msgstr ""
"Gerencie sua loja física de forma mais inteligente: controle vendas, estoque e clientes em tempo real com um PDV poderoso feito para o WooCommerce."

#: includes/Admin/Dashboard/Pages/Extensions.php:170
msgid "Texty"
msgstr "Texty"

#: includes/Admin/Dashboard/Pages/Extensions.php:171
msgid ""
"Stay connected with instant SMS alerts - notify vendors and customers about orders, updates, and key actions without missing a moment."
msgstr ""
"Mantenha-se conectado com alertas SMS instantâneos — notifique vendedores e clientes sobre pedidos, atualizações e ações-chave sem perder um momento."

#: includes/Admin/Dashboard/Pages/Extensions.php:181
#: includes/Admin/RecommendedPlugins.php:64
msgid "StoreGrowth"
msgstr "StoreGrowth"

#: includes/Admin/Dashboard/Pages/Extensions.php:182
msgid ""
"Accelerate your store growth with smart tools - boost engagement, increase conversions, and turn more visitors into paying customers."
msgstr ""
"Acelere o crescimento de sua loja com ferramentas inteligentes — aumente o engajamento, aumente as conversões e transforme mais visitantes em clientes que pagam."

#: includes/Admin/Dashboard/Pages/Extensions.php:192
#: includes/Admin/RecommendedPlugins.php:73
msgid "weDocs"
msgstr "weDocs"

#: includes/Admin/Dashboard/Pages/Extensions.php:193
msgid ""
"Build a self-serve help center for your marketplace. Publish vendor-specific docs alongside store guides so vendors find answers instantly."
msgstr ""
"Crie uma central de ajuda de autoatendimento para o seu marketplace. Publique documentação específica para vendedores junto com os guias da loja, para que eles encontrem respostas na hora."

#: includes/Admin/Dashboard/Pages/Extensions.php:203
msgid "TryAura"
msgstr "TryAura"

#: includes/Admin/Dashboard/Pages/Extensions.php:204
msgid ""
"Deliver immersive virtual try-ons - help customers visualize products better, build confidence, and increase conversions across your store."
msgstr ""
"Ofereça provadores virtuais imersivos: ajude os clientes a visualizar melhor os produtos, comprar com mais confiança e aumentar as conversões em toda a sua loja."

#: includes/Admin/Dashboard/Pages/Extensions.php:214
msgid "WPUF"
msgstr "WPUF"

#: includes/Admin/Dashboard/Pages/Extensions.php:215
msgid ""
"Enable frontend control for users - collect posts, registrations, and data easily without backend access, improving user experience."
msgstr ""
"Habilite controle de frontend para usuários — colete posts, registros e dados facilmente sem acesso ao backend, melhorando a experiência do usuário."

#: includes/Admin/Dashboard/Pages/Extensions.php:225
#: includes/Admin/RecommendedPlugins.php:46
msgid "weMail"
msgstr "weMail"

#: includes/Admin/Dashboard/Pages/Extensions.php:226
msgid ""
"Simplify email marketing with automation - engage customers, nurture leads, and drive repeat sales with powerful campaigns."
msgstr ""
"Simplifique o marketing por e-mail com automação — engaje clientes, cultive leads e impulsione vendas recorrentes com campanhas poderosas."

#: includes/Admin/Dashboard/Pages/Extensions.php:236
msgid "CartPulse"
msgstr "CartPulse"

#: includes/Admin/Dashboard/Pages/Extensions.php:237
msgid ""
"Recover abandoned carts automatically - send timely follow-ups and bring customers back to complete their purchases and boost revenue."
msgstr ""
"Recupere carrinhos abandonados automaticamente — envie acompanhamentos oportunos e traga clientes de volta para concluir suas compras e aumentar receita."

#: includes/Admin/Dashboard/Pages/Extensions.php:247
msgid "Conversion Tracking for WooCommerce"
msgstr "Rastreamento de conversões para WooCommerce"

#: includes/Admin/Dashboard/Pages/Extensions.php:248
msgid ""
"Track conversions, optimize campaigns, and use clear insights to boost ROI and drive smarter growth."
msgstr ""
"Rastreie conversões, otimize campanhas e use insights claros para aumentar o ROI e impulsionar crescimento mais inteligente."

#: includes/Admin/Dashboard/Pages/Extensions.php:258
#: assets/js/dokan-pro-features.js:2
msgid "Dokan Migrator"
msgstr "Dokan Migrator"

#: includes/Admin/Dashboard/Pages/Extensions.php:259
msgid ""
"Migrate your marketplace with ease - transfer data securely from other platforms and launch quickly without losing valuable information."
msgstr ""
"Migre seu marketplace com facilidade — transfira dados com segurança de outras plataformas e inicie rapidamente sem perder informações valiosas."

#: includes/Admin/Dashboard/Pages/Extensions.php:338
msgid "Dokan Customer App"
msgstr "Dokan Customer App"

#: includes/Admin/Dashboard/Pages/Extensions.php:339
msgid "For Customers"
msgstr "Para clientes"

#: includes/Admin/Dashboard/Pages/Extensions.php:340
msgid ""
"A fully-featured shopping app for your Dokan marketplace customers. Browse vendor stores, discover products, place orders, and track deliveries all from one place."
msgstr ""
"Um aplicativo de compras completo para clientes do seu marketplace Dokan. Procure lojas de vendedores, descubra produtos, faça pedidos e acompanhe entregas tudo em um único lugar."

#: includes/Admin/Dashboard/Pages/Extensions.php:347
msgid "Dokan Vendor App"
msgstr "Dokan Vendor App"

#: includes/Admin/Dashboard/Pages/Extensions.php:348
msgid "For Vendors"
msgstr "Para vendedores"

#: includes/Admin/Dashboard/Pages/Extensions.php:349
msgid ""
"Gives vendors complete control over their store on the go. Manage products, process orders, view earnings, and respond to customer queries without needing a desktop."
msgstr ""
"Dá aos vendedores controle total da loja de qualquer lugar. Gerencie produtos, processe pedidos, acompanhe ganhos e responda aos clientes sem precisar de um computador."

#: includes/Admin/Dashboard/Pages/Extensions.php:356
msgid "Delivery Driver App"
msgstr "Aplicativo para entregadores"

#: includes/Admin/Dashboard/Pages/Extensions.php:357
msgid "For Delivery Staff"
msgstr "Para entregadores"

#: includes/Admin/Dashboard/Pages/Extensions.php:358
msgid ""
"Built for delivery agents to accept tasks, navigate routes, update delivery status in real time, and communicate with customers and vendors seamlessly."
msgstr ""
"Construído para que agentes de entrega aceitem tarefas, naveguem rotas, atualizem o status de entrega em tempo real e comuniquem-se com clientes e vendedores perfeitamente."

